      "writtenOn": "2024-10-23T11:38:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We want to have two pieces of information about a specific device: `dev_driver_string(dev)` and `dev_name(dev)`.\n\nDuring the operation of `device_shutdown()`, if a watchdog reset occurs, we can determine which device\u0027s shutdown was being performed.",
      "parentUuid": "b5de2d52_2d641e59",
      "revId": "123ef0a2c5f4b62db9edec5b99d2203e2ea0644a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
